{"id": "19-118-2-5", "zh": "34. 元音之后（辅音）重叠", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-119-2-9", "zh": "元音之后的辅音，有时成为两个形式。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-119-10-17", "zh": "这里，在“重复式重叠”与“本位重叠”两种重叠之中，应当理解为本位重叠。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-120-2-37", "zh": "这种重叠也发生在 pa、pati、paṭi、kama、kusa、kudha、kī、gaha、juta、ñā、si、su、sū、sambhū、sara、sasa 等词的首辅音上。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-120-38-55", "zh": "例如 idha pamādo 成为 idhappamādo；同样有 appamādo、vippayutto、suppasanno；sammā padhānaṃ 成为 sammappadhānaṃ，长元音变为短元音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-120-56-62", "zh": "appativattiyo、adhippatipaccayo、suppatiṭṭhito。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-120-63-68", "zh": "appaṭipuggalo、vippaṭisāro、suppaṭipatti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-120-69-83", "zh": "pakkamo、paṭikkamo、hetukkamo；ākamati 成为 akkamati，同样有 pakkamati、yathākkamaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-120-84-93", "zh": "akkosati、paṭikkosati、anukkosati；ākosati 成为 akkosati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-120-94-97", "zh": "akkuddho、abhikkuddho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-120-98-103", "zh": "dhanakkīto、vikkayo、anukkayo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-120-104-113", "zh": "paggaho、viggaho、anuggaho、candaggāho、diṭṭhiggāho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-120-114-119", "zh": "pajjoto、vijjoto、ujjoto。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-120-120-129", "zh": "kataññū、viññū、paññāṇaṃ、viññāṇaṃ、anaññāṇaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-120-130-135", "zh": "avassayo、nissayo、samussayo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-120-136-141", "zh": "appassuto、vissuto、bahussuto。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-120-142-145", "zh": "āsavā 成为 assavā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-120-146-149", "zh": "passambhento、vissambhento。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-120-150-157", "zh": "aṭṭassaro、vissarati、anussarati、anussati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-120-158-167", "zh": "passasanto、vissasanto、muhussasanto；āsāso 成为 assāso。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-120-168-187", "zh": "“等”字包括 avissajento、vissajento、abhikkantataro、pariccajento、upaddavo、upakkileso、mittadduno、āyabyayo、abbahi 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-121-2-12", "zh": "tika、taya、tiṃsa、vata 等的首辅音也重叠。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-121-13-18", "zh": "kusalattikaṃ、pītittikaṃ、hetuttikaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-121-19-24", "zh": "lokattayaṃ、bodhittayaṃ、vatthuttayaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-121-25-32", "zh": "ekattiṃsa、dvattiṃsa、tettiṃsa、catuttiṃsa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-121-33-36", "zh": "sīlabbataṃ、subbato。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-121-37-43", "zh": "sappītiko、samannāgato、punappunaṃ 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-122-2-19", "zh": "vatu、vaṭa、disa 等的末辅音也重叠，如 vattati、vaṭṭati、dassanaṃ、phasso 等。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-123-2-17", "zh": "在 u、du、ni 等前缀，以及 ta、catu、cha 和由 santa 替换而成的 sa 等之后，后面的辅音也重叠。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-123-18-58", "zh": "ukaṃso 成为 ukkaṃso；同样有 dukkaraṃ、nikkaṅkho、uggataṃ、duccaritaṃ、nijjaṭaṃ、ujjahaṃ、uccaṅgaṃ、unnamati、dukkaro、niddaro、unnato、duppañño、nimmalo、uyyutto、dullabho、nibbatto、ussāho、nissāro。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-123-59-86", "zh": "takkaro、tajjo、tanninno、tappabhavo、tammayo、catukkaṃ、catuddisaṃ、catuppado、catubbidhaṃ、catussālaṃ、chakkaṃ、channavuti、chappadiko、chabbassāni。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-123-87-96", "zh": "sakkāro、sagguṇo、sandiṭṭhi、sappuriso、mahabbalo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-124-2-25", "zh": "在非词尾、除 ā 以外的长元音之后，ya 音也重叠，如 niyyāti、suyyati、abhibhuyya、viceyya、vineyya、dheyyaṃ、neyyaṃ、seyyo、jeyyo、veyyākaraṇo。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-124-26-34", "zh": "为什么说“除 ā 以外”？如 mālāya、dolāya、samādāya（不重叠）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-125-2-11", "zh": "为了维护韵律也会重叠，如 nappajahe vaṇṇabalaṃ purāṇaṃ、ujjugatesu seyyo、gacchanti suggatiṃ。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-125-12-18", "zh": "为什么说“元音之后”？如 ñāyo、taṃkhaṇaṃ（不重叠）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-125-19-34", "zh": "正因为说“有时”，所以 nikāyo、nidānaṃ、nivāso、tato、chasaṭṭhi、upanīyati、sūyati 不重叠。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-126-2-7", "zh": "35. 第四、第二辅音在后时，它们（重叠的前一个）成为第三、第一辅音", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-127-2-11", "zh": "当第四、第二辅音在后时，这些第四、第二辅音（重叠的前一个）按发音最近的原则，变为同组的第三、第一辅音。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-127-12-56", "zh": "各组中，gha、jha、ḍha、dha、bha 是第四辅音；kha、cha、ṭha、tha、pha 是第二辅音；ga、ja、ḍa、da、ba 是第三辅音；ka、ca、ṭa、ta、pa 是第一辅音。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-127-57-67", "zh": "在 pa、u、du、ni 等之后，后面的 gha 等重叠时，（前一个）变为第三、第一辅音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-127-68-78", "zh": "pagarati 成为 paggharati；同样有 uggharati、nigghoso、ugghāṭeti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-127-79-88", "zh": "esova tajjhānaphalo、paṭhamajjhānaṃ、abhijjhāyati、ujjhāyati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-127-89-92", "zh": "daḍḍho、buḍḍho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-127-93-102", "zh": "viddhaṃseti、uddhaṃsito、uddhāro、niddhano、niddhuto。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-127-103-116", "zh": "vibbhanto、ubbhanto、samubbhanto、dubbhikkhaṃ、nibbhayaṃ、tabbhāvo、catubbhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-127-117-120", "zh": "saddhā、saddhammo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-127-121-122", "zh": "mahabbhayaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-128-2-9", "zh": "短元音之后的各组第二辅音如果重叠，（前一个）就变为第一辅音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-128-10-26", "zh": "pañcakkhandhā；同样有 rūpakkhandho、akkhamo、abhikkhaṇaṃ、avikkhepo、jātikkhettaṃ、dhātukkhobho、āyukkhayo。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-128-27-39", "zh": "setacchattaṃ；同样有 sabbacchannaṃ、vicchannaṃ、bodhicchāyā、jambucchāyā、samucchedo。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-128-40-59", "zh": "tatra ṭhito 成为 tatraṭṭhito；同样有 thalaṭṭhaṃ、jalaṭṭhaṃ、aṭṭhitaṃ、niṭṭhitaṃ、cattāriṭṭhānāni、garuṭṭhāniyo、samuṭṭhito。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-128-60-73", "zh": "sabbatthāmena、yasatthero、pattharati、vitthāro、abhitthuto、vitthambhito、anutthunaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-128-74-85", "zh": "papphoṭeti、mahapphalaṃ、anipphalaṃ、vipphāro、paripphuṭeyya、madhupphāṇitaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-128-86-98", "zh": "长音 ā 之后：ākhāto 成为 akkhāto；同样有 taṇhākkhayo、āṇākkhettaṃ、saññākkhandho。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-128-99-111", "zh": "āchādayi 成为 acchādayi；同样有 acchindati、nāvaṭṭhaṃ、attharati、apphoṭeti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-128-112-140", "zh": "正因为说“有时”，所以 puvakhajjakaṃ、tassa chaviādīni chinditvā、yathāṭhitaṃ、kammaphalaṃ、sīlaṃ tassa jhāyino、ye jhānappasutā dhīrā、nidhanaṃ、mahādhanaṃ 不重叠。（重叠连声）", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-129-2-34", "zh": "akaramha se te、so kho byanti kāhiti、so gacchaṃ na nivattati、eso attho、eso ābhogo、eso idāni——在这些情况下，“ve”一词延续下来。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-130-2-7", "zh": "37. e、o 在字母之前变为 a", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-131-2-8", "zh": "在字母之前，e、o 有时可以变为 a。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-131-9-37", "zh": "如 akaramha sa te 与 akaramha se te；同样有 sa kho byanti kāhiti、sa gacchaṃ na nivattati、esa attho、esa ābhogo、esa idāni。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-131-38-51", "zh": "为什么说“在字母之前”？如 amoghavacano ca so、gandhabbānaṃ adhipati、mahārājā yasassi so 中的 so（不变）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-131-52-82", "zh": "由于说过“连声与复合不施于 vaddha”，所以偈颂中间不作连声；在所说的“tividhassa”中，后面即使有字母，也不叫作“在后的”。（元音辅音连声）", "confidence": 40}
{"id": "19-132-2-28", "zh": "ata yantaṃ、tatha yaṃ、mada yaṃ、budha yati、dhana yaṃ、seva yo、para yesanā、pokkharaṇa yo——在这些情况下：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-133-2-7", "zh": "48. ta 组辅音与 va、ra、ṇa 在 ya 之前变为 ca 组辅音与 ba、ya、ña", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-134-2-7", "zh": "在 ya 音之前，ta 组辅音与 va、ra、ṇa 依次变为 ca 组辅音与 ba、ya、ña。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-134-8-16", "zh": "再依“vaggalasehi te”一条，（ya）同化为前面的音。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-134-17-32", "zh": "accantaṃ、tacchaṃ、majjaṃ、bujjhati、dhaññaṃ、sebbo、payyesanā、pokkharañño。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-134-33-48", "zh": "apuccaṇḍakāyaṃ、jaccandho、yajjevaṃ、ajjhagamā、ajjhattaṃ、ajjhupagato、ajjhogāhetvā、dibbaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-134-49-52", "zh": "正因为说“有时”，所以有 ratyā（不变）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-135-2-43", "zh": "saka yate、ruca yate、paca yate、aṭa yate、lupa yate、kupa yate、sala yate、phala yate、disa yate、asa yate——在这些情况下，“ye”一词延续到下面要说的两条规则。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-136-2-4", "zh": "49. 在组辅音、la、sa 之后（ya）变为它们", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-137-2-9", "zh": "在组辅音、la、sa 之后的 ya 音，有时变为那些组辅音、la、sa。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-137-10-29", "zh": "sakkate、ruccate、paccate、aṭṭate、luppate、kuppate、sallate、phallate、dissate、assate。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-137-30-33", "zh": "正因为说“有时”，所以有 kyāhaṃ（不变）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-138-2-10", "zh": "muha yati、guha yati——在这些情况下：", "confidence": 75}
